OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day with patchy rain
OL,6,Fwhich turns heavier and more
OL,7,Fpersistent across Shetland from around
OL,8,Fmid-day, then Orkney towards early
OL,9,Fevening. Strong to gale west to
OL,10,Fsouthwest winds easing and veering
OL,11,Flate afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOvercast with periods of
OL,14,Foccasionally heavy rain through the
OL,15,Fevening, which turns patchy and
OL,16,Foccasionally wintry to low levels
OL,17,Fovernight, as fresh to strong
OL,18,Fnortherly winds develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
