OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FPatchy rain, sleet and snow
OL,6,Finitially. Turning dry and bright
OL,7,Fduring morning. Showers developing
OL,8,Flater in day. Cold in brisk north to
OL,9,Fnorthwest winds, with temperatures
OL,10,Fwell down from Saturday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FShowers and brief spells of weak
OL,14,Fwinter sunshine throughout the outlook
OL,15,Fperiod. Temperatures seasonally low
OL,16,Fgiven the generally northerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
